  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.amc-12-2001-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Adding \\(3\\) to each number raises the sum from \\(S\\) to \\(S + 6.\\) Doubling each number doubles the sum, giving \\[ 2(S + 6) = 2S + 12. \\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
